{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3304","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3304","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3304\",\"parent_revision\":\"12ac6e55961cec164f0e38254e55bc453983fb58e5c658c1bf9eacffe7f6e4cf\",\"root_revision\":\"12ac6e55961cec164f0e38254e55bc453983fb58e5c658c1bf9eacffe7f6e4cf\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-29\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nWhen `GITHUB_TOKEN` is unset (forcing the local `github-cache` fallback path for the GitHub-backed SAM/backlog provider), `ContentTaskProvider` eager-loads ALL cached plan records at init and crashes with:\\n\\n`ScannerError: while scanning a double-quoted scalar ... found unknown escape character '|'` (ruamel.yaml)\\n\\nThis is a corrupted entry somewhere in `~/.dh/projects/-Users-jamienelson-repos-claude_skills/github-cache/`, unrelated to any specific plan. Because the loader is eager (not lazy/per-plan), a single corrupted cache file blocks ANY local-fallback plan-state operation for the entire project \u2014 not just the plan being read. This makes the local fallback unusable as a resilience mechanism during upstream GitHub API instability (e.g. rate limiting or transient token issues), which is exactly when it's needed most.\\n\\nUser-provided context: not yet identified which specific cached file/entry is corrupted or how it got that way \u2014 the fix (locate and repair/quarantine the bad entry, and/or make the loader tolerate a single bad entry without failing the whole load) has not been investigated.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: QG Context Refinement follow-up from #3277 (bookend-validator-wiring) \u2014 discovered while working around a transient GITHUB_TOKEN 403\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-29\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"72b8e803f98f2fc47682f36915cb4fa528676e2bef92e90eb1715cd832665d1f\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABRZ5gwQ\"}"}